      "description": "Outlined signup action shown on a dark sample backing.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-welcome-backing\"><button class=\"ds-create ds-control\">Create account</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-welcome-backing{padding:16px;background:#0A1014}.ds-create{min-height:52px;width:100%;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.35);border-radius:13px;background:rgba(8,13,16,.35);color:#fff;font:600 17px Manrope,system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-control:hover:not(:disabled){opacity:.96}.ds-control:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #087D52;outline-offset:3px}.ds-control:active:not(:disabled){opacity:.92;transform:scale(.97)}.ds-control:disabled{opacity:.35}.ds-control{transition:opacity 100ms ease-out,transform 100ms ease-out}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-control:active:not(:disabled){transform:none}}"
